1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,917
Meet Impo, your open-source personal agent.

2
00:00:02,917 --> 00:00:07,347
Remember what matters, get things done, and find your next good buy.

3
00:00:08,147 --> 00:00:14,928
Looking for a commuter backpack under a hundred and fifty dollars? Impo finds products and helps you compare.

4
00:00:14,928 --> 00:00:19,134
Explore photos, prices, and details, then open the merchant to buy.

5
00:00:19,934 --> 00:00:22,276
Capture a thought with Echo on your phone.

6
00:00:22,276 --> 00:00:27,817
Come back to the transcript, and choose which speech is yours before it becomes personal context.

7
00:00:28,617 --> 00:00:31,728
Impo brings useful memories into your next conversation.

8
00:00:31,728 --> 00:00:35,858
You can browse what it remembers and forget what you no longer want kept.

9
00:00:36,658 --> 00:00:40,302
Give research, planning, or a first draft its own task.

10
00:00:40,302 --> 00:00:42,799
Work continues when you leave the app.

11
00:00:42,799 --> 00:00:44,823
Schedule recurring tasks, too.

12
00:00:45,623 --> 00:00:49,116
Your Feed turns the context you share into useful next steps.

13
00:00:49,116 --> 00:00:51,386
A little perspective for the day ahead.

14
00:00:52,186 --> 00:00:54,918
Connections and phone permissions are optional.

15
00:00:54,918 --> 00:00:59,372
The clients and backend are open source, so you can explore how Impo works.

16
00:01:00,172 --> 00:01:02,117
Try Impo on the web or Android.

17
00:01:02,117 --> 00:01:05,230
iOS is in TestFlight, with public access pending.

18
00:01:05,230 --> 00:01:08,148
What can your personal agent help with today?.
